      "Points to security documentation on permissions, networking, filesystem mounts, host functions, and resource limits.",
      "Lists npm and TypeScript guides for Node.js projects.",
      "Lists benchmarks and comparisons with options such as container sandboxes, Cloudflare Workers, and QuickJS.",
      "Points to use case guides for agent code tools, development servers, and plugin systems."
